			"width": 560,
			"height": 360,
			"text": "## miles-keep\nstyle\n# Holds Miles steady in edits: only the named part changes.\ntemplate: \"Keep the exact same person: same face, hair and clothes (Miles Parker, a hip NYC-born graphic designer in his early thirties, sharp undercut, vintage band t-shirt under a blazer, an easy grin). Keep the exact same framing, crop, camera position and pose, and the same flat, evenly lit chroma-key green screen background, lighting and camera quality. Only change {prompt}\"\n"
