			"y": 5000,
			"width": 560,
			"height": 460,
			"text": "## miles-at-desk\nedit\nstatus: done\nmodel: qwen-edit\nsize: 1024x1024\nseed: 31\nprompt: \"Show the same person, with the same face, hair and clothes, now seated behind a 1970s Italian modern desk from his boss's retro furniture collection: a low desk with a glossy orange lacquer top with rounded corners on polished chrome legs. On it: a beige 1990s computer monitor, a small white space-age record player, a few design sketches. He leans back in a white moulded plastic and chrome Italian swivel chair, grinning at the camera. Straight-on front view, the camera square to the desk at seated eye level: the front edge of the desk is perfectly horizontal and parallel to the bottom of the picture, both ends of the desk at the same height, the desk top barely visible. The whole desk and chair fit in the frame with empty space on both sides. No green objects. Flat, evenly lit pure green screen background, no floor, no shadow, no walls.\"\n",
			"color": "4"
		},
